records/5/title_i18n/kr","메린"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","等下要去大采购！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/kr","좀 있다가 쇼핑을 왕창 할 거야!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415538.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415538.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/kr","메린"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/kr","여기서 야영하실 건가요? 이럴 줄 알았으면 집에 연락이라도 할 걸 그랬어요..."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/kr","메린 & 페이"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","我啊，一直都想有些弟弟妹妹……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/kr","나도 항상 동생들이 있으면 좋겠다고 생각했어..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/kr","페이 & 메린"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","啊，糟糕，箭囊上的毛皮好像被打湿了……"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/kr","아, 큰일이다. 화살 주머니 가죽이 젖은 것 같아..."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414170.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn3/herohub_story/10414170.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/kr","메린 & 치피"]]}